{"id":"en_wake-me-up-my-first-love","title":"Wake Me Up, My First Love","titleEn":"Wake Me Up, My First Love","description":"Cathy, who leads the Scorpion Gang with a fierce hand, is left comatose by a car crash that was staged. On regaining consciousness, she finds that her family's elders have tricked her into taking Prince Alexander of Monaco into her home, supposedly as a sperm donor so that she can secure an heir. The two get off to a hostile start, yet attraction gradually builds between them. What neither knows is that Alexander is the childhood sweetheart Cathy lost touch with long ago, and that each has been looking for the other all this time.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/wake-me-up-my-first-love/it_IT/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/wake-me-up-my-first-love/it_IT/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Identitate ascunsă","Verborgene Identität","Hidden Identity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds644/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_wake-me-up-my-first-love_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds644/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wake-me-up-my-first-love_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds644/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wake-me-up-my-first-love_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds644/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wake-me-up-my-first-love_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://r